From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 23:57:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Thief: a tracing layout test, and the TLAS instances by kind

rgThiefTracingTest(int), from the game's panel: 1 see-through (alpha
tested) triangles traced as solid; 2 the kept map in one piece; 3 in 48 m
pieces; 4 still objects taken into the map's pieces; 5 both 3 and 4. To
find what makes long rays outdoors slow. The stats print the TLAS
instances by kind (map pieces, objects' own, with see-through triangles).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0137FfF2kXgpYFjmGxKqakLV
---
